    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66712" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετακλαίω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weep afterwards</i> or <i>too late</i>, 
